[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0010","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0019","text":"智代子的朋友"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0020","text":"如果小千代不介意的话，如果有兴趣的话\n能不能请你成为偶像呢……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0030","text":"也许这样说很任性……\n但我希望你能替我实现那个我无法完成的梦想"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0040","text":"……园田小姐，如果你愿意的话\n要不要成为我负责的偶像组合的一员？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0050","text":"……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0060","text":"！\n好的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0070","text":"智代子，差不多该准备上场了，可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0080","text":"好的！\n谢谢您！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0082","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0090","text":"────正式演出，加油啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21000100_02_0100","text":"好的！"}]
